  "title": {
   "en": "Tsuma no Nakami wa Kodomo no Mama Datta no de Aru."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "妻の中身は子供のままだったのである。"
   },
   {
    "en": "My Wife's Still a Child! (At Night...)"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "I live a pure and simple newlywed life. But, if I had to name one problem... It'd be that my wife is still a child inside! She doesn't know anything about what happens in the bedroom! We are still a couple but I can't force myself on her. I really don't know how to convey my feelings to her either... Oh, my god. Everything's jiggling! My pure, naive wife's driving me crazy!",
   "ja": "無邪気で初々しい新婚生活。ただ唯一にして最大の問題がある。中身が子供な妻は夜の営みを知らないようなのだ!! 夫婦とはいえ無理やりにはできないし、どうやって伝えるべきか……。ああ、ほらもう。あちこち揺れちゃってますよ！"
  },
